# Documentation-first changes

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/INDEX.md` before modifying the repository.
- Read the relevant `docs/features/*.md` files before changing a capability.
- If a new capability has no document, create one from `docs/templates/FEATURE.md` first and add it to `docs/INDEX.md`.
- Update feature docs in the same change when behavior, schemas, states, errors, approvals, tests, or security boundaries change.
- Update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for component or data-flow changes.
- Update `TODO.md` only when completion is supported by verification evidence.
- If documentation and implementation disagree, reconcile them before completing the task.

